1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:02,520
快看 走廊里
Look -- in the hallway!

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,700
有只鸟 有架飞机
It's a bird! It's a plane!

3
00:00:05,420 --> 00:00:06,660
真是超上气不接下气啊
It's super-out-of-breath.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,020
也祝你万圣节快乐
Happy Halloween to you, too.

5
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:08,920
对不起 我只是
I'm sorry. I'm just --

6
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,940
我很担心今天的结辩陈词
I'm really nervous about this closing argument today.

7
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,920
是因为你已经连输三个案子了吗
Is it because you've lost three cases in a row?

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,960
这么小声说也不会减轻痛苦的
Whispering it doesn't make it any less painful.

9
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:15,900
-抱歉 -好了
- Sorry. - Okay.

10
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:17,600
不是 是这个案子本身
No, it's just that this case --

11
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,320
很难维持陪审团的注意力
It's so hard to hold the jury's attention.

12
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,940
你要跟我排练一遍你的陈词吗
Well, do you want to run your argument by me?

13
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,000
-可以吗 -当然
- Could I? - Sure.

14
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:23,900
好
Um, okay.

15
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,980
六年前 阿尔杰证券公司
Six years ago, Alger Equities

16
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:26,800
从市政养老基金
took investments

17
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,140
和个人投资者获得投资
from municipal pension funds and private investors

18
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:31,040
然后将这些资金全部投向海外...
and funneled all of that into offshore --

19
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:31,940
你已经没在听我说了
And I've already lost you.

20
00:00:31,980 --> 00:00:34,980
不 我是在想今天正好是万圣节
No. I was just thinking -- because it's Halloween,

21
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,340
你戴着这个出庭怎么样
what if you wore these in the courtroom?

22
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,960
向陪审团显示"看 我这人很幽默"
Show the jury "Hey, I'm playful."

23
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,520
小卡 我是律师
Cam, I'm an attorney,

24
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:43,320
不是在火车上躲猫猫的兔八哥
not Bugs Bunny trying to hide on a train.

25
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:44,860
我准备好了
I'm ready.

26
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,460
沃尔多来了
There's Waldo!

27
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,620
这次装扮服比赛我要赢了
I think I'm gonna win the costume contest.

28
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,840
亲爱的 赢不赢不重要
Hey, now, honey, it's not important if you win.

29
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:53,140
主要是好玩 来拍个照
It's just for fun. Picture.

30
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:55,100
但如果赢了就更好玩了
But it's more fun if you win.

31
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,280
无意冒犯 小爸
No offense, Daddy.

32
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,800
莉莉最近一直在暗示我
You know, Lily's been letting me know recently

33
00:00:58,800 --> 00:00:59,880
她觉得被冷落了
that she's feeling neglected.

34
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,860
应该是因为我一心扑在橄榄球上
I think it's because of all my football stuff.

35
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:03,700
所以我这次卯足劲儿装扮她
That's why I went all out on her costume.

36
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:06,340
你看是不是一模一样
Look how incredibly accurate it is.

37
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,320
那小家伙在哪儿呢
Where is that little guy?

38
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:09,360
快点 快出现 快点
Come on. Come to me. Come on.

39
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,440
在...在这儿
Here you -- here you go.

40
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,480
无论他盯着沃尔多看多久
No matter how long he stares at it,

41
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:13,940
小卡就是找不到他
Cam cannot find Waldo.

42
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:15,160
太不可思议了
It's crazy.

43
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:17,400
有一次 他指着理发店外的旋转彩柱
O-once, he pointed to a barber pole,

44
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,020
我们就让他以为他找对了
and we just gave it to him.

45
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:20,960
那小家伙在哪儿
Where is the little guy?

46
00:01:22,505 --> 00:01:23,160
就在这儿
He's right there.

47
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:24,360
你是怎么这么快找到...
How do you find it so...

48
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,360
你试试这个
Let's try these.

49
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:42,500
好了
Okay.

50
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:45,660
伙计们 你们觉得我今晚穿这身怎么样
Boys, what do you think about my costume for tonight?

51
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:46,840
看起来好极了 亲爱的
You look dynamite, honey.

52
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:49,760
谢谢 我是菲欧娜公主
Ay, thank you. I am Princess Fiona.

53
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,900
这样我要扮王子吗
So does that make me a prince?

54
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,440
我得一整晚都扶着个王冠吗
Do I have to keep track of a crown all night?

55
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,840
不 你扮史瑞克 那头怪物
No, you're Shrek, the ogre.

56
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,640
你是说那个绿怪物吗
You mean that big green thing?

57
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:57,460
不 我才不想一整晚都戴着
Nah, I don't want to walk around all night

58
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,780
丑兮兮的橡胶面具
with an ugly rubber mask.

59
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:00,860
不用 你只要把脸涂成绿色
No. You just need to paint your face green,

60
00:02:00,860 --> 00:02:01,660
就可以了
and that's it.

61
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:04,600
你每次都这样
You do this every time.

62
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,900
你自己扮成公主 我就得扮成个怪物
You go as a princess. I have to go as some freak.

63
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,877
你当美女 我当野兽
You're beauty, I'm the beast.

64
00:02:08,877 --> 00:02:11,200
你当碧昂斯 我就是...那谁
You're Beyonce? I'm...that guy.

65
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:14,020
你又不跟我一起去买装扮服
Well, you never want to go shopping with me for costumes,

66
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,260
所以我想买什么就买什么
so I get what I want,

67
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:16,920
你就得跟我配套
and you are what comes with it.

68
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:18,660
今年 我要自己打扮一套
Well, this year, I'm getting my own costume,

69
00:02:18,660 --> 00:02:20,410
打扮得很健壮 充满男子汉气概
and it's gonna be tough and manly --

70
00:02:20,421 --> 00:02:23,320
比如牛仔或者建筑工人
maybe a cowboy or a construction worker.

71
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:23,660
你知道
You know that

72
00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:26,060
米奇和小卡去年就是那样穿的吧
that's what Mitch and Cam wore last year, right?

73
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,600
该死 我切到我的手指了
Damn it! I cut my finger!

74
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:31,380
万圣节快乐
Happy Halloween.

75
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:34,040
我是说真的 我切到手指了 你看
No, really -- I cut myself. Look!

76
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,160
很逼真啊
That looks great.

77
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,340
那血是用什么弄的
What'd you use to make the blood?

78
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:38,020
用刀 我真的受伤了
A knife. I'm actually hurt.

79
00:02:38,492 --> 00:02:40,887
水平很高嘛 亲爱的
Great production value, sweetheart.

80
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:41,860
了不起
I'm impressed.

81
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,820
难以置信万圣节我还得上班
Can't believe I've got to go to work on Halloween.

82
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:44,660
真讨厌
This blows!

83
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:46,038
别担心 你回家的时候
Don't worry.By the time you get home,

84
00:02:46,038 --> 00:02:48,329
奇妙乐园就已经投入运作了
AwesomeLand will be up and running.

85
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,960
克莱尔今年工作很忙
Claire's busy with work this year,

86
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,220
所以由我来负责万圣节活动
so I'm taking over the halloween duties.

87
00:02:52,220 --> 00:02:54,740
我的主题是奇妙乐园
My theme is AwesomeLand.

88
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:57,240
包含一切菲尔觉得很奇妙的东西
Which includes anything Phil finds awesome.

89
00:02:57,600 --> 00:02:58,700
比如一把巨大的伞
It's a pretty big umbrella.

90
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:01,420
巨大的美丽的伞 简直太奇妙了
Big, pretty umbrellas -- those are awesome.

91
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,380
克莱尔喜欢血 内脏啊 暴力什么的
Claire loves blood and guts and gore,

92
00:03:04,380 --> 00:03:06,040
但谁说万圣节一定要这么吓人
but who says Halloween has to be scary?

93
00:03:06,140 --> 00:03:07,340
除了你之外的所有人
Everybody but you.

94
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:08,460
这简直要让她气死了
This is killing her.

95
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:10,482
至少有什么要死掉了
At least something's dying.

96
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:11,880
现在开庭
Court is now in session.

97
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:15,760
律师 准备好做结辩陈词了吗
Counselor, are you ready to deliver closing arguments?

98
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:16,640
是的 法官大人
Yes, your honor.

99
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:17,760
那就开始
Well, let's get --

100
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,780
等等 奥利呢
Wait. Where is Holly?

101
00:03:22,780 --> 00:03:24,760
抱歉 法官大人 我的公交车晚了
Sorry, your honor. My bus was late.

102
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,040
律师 开始吧
Counselor, proceed.

103
00:03:28,644 --> 00:03:29,907
好的
O-okay.

104
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,140
各位陪审团成员
Ladies and gentlemen of the jury,

105
00:03:33,300 --> 00:03:35,560
这件案子的细节
the details of this case are --

106
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,440
复杂又充满专业术语
are complicated and technical,

107
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:41,833
但是对受害者有悲惨又深远的影响
but they have a, uh, a tragic and profound effect on the victims.

108
00:03:42,534 --> 00:03:43,566
那个...
Uh, the, um...

109
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:49,200
养老金遭到滥用 生活被毁
pensions were squandered, lives were destroyed,

110
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:51,860
曾经很有前途的职业
and careers, once so promising,

111
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,980
现在全完了
were now...ruined.

112
00:03:55,380 --> 00:03:56,580
因为这段婚姻
So, because of this marriage,

113
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:58,680
你基本上就是歌手夏奇拉的第三个表弟了
you're basically third cousins with Shakira.

114
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,320
我们没法拿到免费的演唱会门票
I mean, we don't get the free tickets,

115
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,180
但很好玩
but it's fun.

116
00:04:04,927 --> 00:04:06,900
天啊 这是什么
Ay, dios mios. What is this?

117
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:09,500
怎么了公主 我是白马王子
What's up, princess? I'm Prince Charming.

118
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:10,940
我能看出来
I can see that.

119
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,680
我给乔准备了驴子装扮服
I got Joe a donkey costume,

120
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,380
给斯黛拉准备了猫耳
and I got Stella cat ears.

121
00:04:14,380 --> 00:04:15,880
希望她不要追赶自己
I just hope she doesn't chase herself.

122
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:18,320
我懂 因为她是一只狗
Ah, I get it -- because she's a dog.

123
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,380
我还发现菲奥娜公主
I also found out that Princess Fiona

124
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:22,940
应该戴皇冠 所以给你
is supposed to wear a tiara, so here you go.

125
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,190
他们有一桶呢
They had a whole bucket full of 'em.

126
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,840
我好喜欢
I love it.

127
00:04:26,114 --> 00:04:28,540
你看起来好帅
Ay, and you look so handsome.

128
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:30,660
像是你当海军时拍的照片上的样子
It's like those pictures of you in the navy.

129
00:04:31,460 --> 00:04:32,100
我有个主意
I have an idea.

130
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:34,560
不如我们让乔睡个午觉
Why don't we put Joe down for a nap

131
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:36,180
然后我们也去休息会儿
and then we go and take a nap,

132
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,320
但不是去睡...
but not the one we sleep --

133
00:04:37,380 --> 00:04:38,860
我明白 我加入
I got it. I'm in.

134
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:39,500
好
Okay.

135
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,120
你今天不是要开重大会议吗
Hey. I thought you had a big meeting.

136
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,622
是啊 但我把手机忘在家里了
I do, but I left my cellphone here.

137
00:04:43,622 --> 00:04:45,040
我需要在红灯时用手机阅读
I need it to read at stoplights

138
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,460
这样就不会乱想了
so I don't think about stuff.

139
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:47,770
抱歉 这太荒唐了
I'm sorry, but that's ridiculous.

140
00:04:48,244 --> 00:04:50,500
亲爱的 这好像不大合适
Ohhh. Honey, I don't think that fits.

141
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:51,740
在奇妙乐园里就很合适
It fits in AwesomeLand.

142
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:53,380
这是魔法帽
It's a magic hat.

143
00:04:53,460 --> 00:04:55,000
我会让这只兔子从里面跳出来
I'm gonna have this bunny jumping out of it.

144
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:56,080
你要在里面放点血吗
You gonna put some blood on it,

145
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,180
也许掉出一个眼球
maybe dangle an eyeball?

146
00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:58,360
谁伤害了你啊
Who hurt you?

147
00:04:59,100 --> 00:04:59,760
我开玩笑的
I'm kidding.

148
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,149
我知道是杰和迪迪
I know it's Jay and Dede.

149
00:05:01,149 --> 00:05:03,555
总之 我得去取装扮服了
Anyway, I got to go get my costume.

150
00:05:04,944 --> 00:05:06,620
看在老天的份上
Oh, for god's sake.

151
00:05:06,785 --> 00:05:08,533
我亲我妈都比那有激情
I kiss my mom hotter than that.

152
00:05:08,533 --> 00:05:10,467
是的 我见过
He does. I seen it.

153
00:05:11,485 --> 00:05:12,421
我们的新邻居
Our new neighbors,

154
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:15,860
医用大麻零售商罗尼和他老婆安布尔
medical-marijuana retailer Ronnie and his wife, Amber,

155
00:05:16,021 --> 00:05:17,420
两个月前搬了过来
moved in two months ago, and --

156
00:05:17,420 --> 00:05:18,500
才一周半啦
It's been a week and a half.

157
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:19,660
天啊 真的吗
Dear god. Really?

158
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:20,400
是啊
Yeah.

159
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,180
我不明白
I don't get it.

160
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,140
一个巨型纸杯蛋糕有什么吓人的
What's scary about a giant cupcake?

161
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,700
今年我们不玩吓人的
We're not doing scary this year.

162
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,180
提醒一下
Well, heads up --

163
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:29,960
我们要举行吓出屎来的恐怖比赛
we're doing crap-your-pants scary on account of the contest,

164
00:05:29,970 --> 00:05:33,544
希望不会冒犯到糖果乐园的你们
so I just hope we don't offend you over here in candy land.

165
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:34,460
什么比赛
What contest?

166
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:36,300
这是我们在之前的社区组织的比赛
Oh, it's something we started in the old neighborhood.

167
00:05:36,820 --> 00:05:39,280
如果你想加入 就交20块
If you're into it, you, uh, chip in 20 bucks,

168
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:41,920
街上最吓人的房子获得奖金[大麻]
and scariest house on the street wins the pot.

169
00:05:42,460 --> 00:05:43,600
不是真的大麻啦
Not actual pot.

170
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,380
我需要处方才能给你拿
I'd have to see a prescription for that.

171
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:47,380
等等 你不是警察...
Wait. You're not a cop --

172
00:05:47,380 --> 00:05:49,180
我都说了12次了 我不是警察
No, for the 12th time, I'm not a cop.

173
00:05:49,180 --> 00:05:51,060
你们的装饰
Well, you are not gonna offend me

174
00:05:51,060 --> 00:05:52,240
不会冒犯到我
with your little decorations.

175
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:54,600
要知道这一切都是菲尔搞的
Please know that this... is Phil.

176
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:56,480
要我来负责 一切都会很可怕的
When I'm in charge, it's terrifying.

177
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:59,200
我相信你会别着一个写着"呸"的胸针
I'll bet you give all the other soccer moms

178
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:01,140
把别的"孩奴"妈妈吓一跳
a good scare with that pin that says "Boo."

179
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:04,640
你真走运我今天要去上班
You are so lucky that I have to go to work today,

180
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,180
否则我会让你见识一下什么叫吓人
or I would show you scary.

181
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:08,460
我会赢得你的小比赛
I would win your little contest.

182
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:10,440
你不知道你的对手有多强大
You don't know what you're up against.

183
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:13,569
我们不会让孕妇或者有心脏病的人
We don't let preggos or people with heart trouble

184
00:06:13,580 --> 00:06:14,460
经过我家大门
past our front gate.

185
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:15,280
几年前
Couple years ago,

186
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:18,580
我们吓得一个人进了医院 他差点吓死
we scared a man Into the hospital almost to death.

187
00:06:18,740 --> 00:06:21,040
既然你有借口 公主
Well, since you got an excuse, princess,

188
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:23,600
看来我的连胜纪录会保持
looks like my winning streak will carry on.

189
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,240
也许我们家的老房子也能赢呢
Might even win at the old house, too.

190
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,660
那地方挺吓人的
We left that place pretty scary.

191
00:06:29,949 --> 00:06:31,800
我要去跟一个朋友喝咖啡
I'm meeting a friend for coffee.

192
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,240
不行
No, you're not. No.

193
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:34,700
你要帮我把这些都弄倒
You're helping me take this all down.

194
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:35,960
全都拿开
Everything goes.

195
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,620
除了兔子
Everything except the bunny.

196
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:41,860
我对兔子有安排
I have plans for the bunny.

197
00:06:43,780 --> 00:06:45,300
好了 数到三 说"啊"
Okay! On three, say "Argh!"

198
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:47,636
-一 二 三 -啊
- Argh One, two, three! - Argh Argh!

199
00:06:47,636 --> 00:06:48,980
太棒了
Oh, that's great.

200
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:50,960
谢谢 你俩是什么关系
Thank you. And how are you two related?

201
00:06:50,960 --> 00:06:52,620
知道吗 不管是异性恋还是同性恋
Uh, you know what -- gay or straight,

202
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:54,780
都可以组建家庭 所以...
there's no wrong way to make a family, so...

203
00:06:54,780 --> 00:06:55,800
好了 别激动
Okay, down, girl.

204
00:06:56,020 --> 00:06:57,820
我是说 你俩扮演的角色有什么关系
I meant, how are your costumes related?

205
00:06:57,860 --> 00:06:59,360
这是亲子装扮服比赛
It's a parent/child costume contest.

206
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:00,100
是吗
It is?

207
00:07:00,211 --> 00:07:01,580
传单上都写得清清楚楚了
It was all clearly stated on the flier.

208
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:02,740
还有传单吗
There was a flier?

209
00:07:02,740 --> 00:07:04,160
我给你看了 大爸
I gave it to you, daddy!

210
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:05,840
我就知道你的装扮服都搞错了
I knew your costume was all wrong!

211
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,140
好吧 别慌张
O-okay, hey, don't panic.

212
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:08,360
游行之前还有很多时间
There's plenty of time before the parade.

213
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:10,520
《寻找沃尔多》里面还有什么人物
Is there another character in "Where's Waldo?"

214
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:11,800
白胡子巫师
Wizard Whitebeard.

215
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,640
那就扮这个了 会很有意思的
Okay! Well, that'll be fun!

216
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:15,080
我上次跟白胡子一起出去玩
I haven't gone out with a Whitebeard

217
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:16,720
还是带我表妹莎莉去舞会的时候
since I took my cousin Sally to the prom.

218
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:18,380
好了 我尽快回来
All right, I'll be back as soon as I can.

219
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,580
莉莉 解释一下大爸的梗
Lily, explain daddy's joke.

220
00:07:23,980 --> 00:07:26,140
我喜欢有头发 我知道怎么物尽其用
I loved having hair, and I knew how to use it.

221
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:28,220
我可以走到美女面前
I'd walk up to a pretty girl

222
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,480
捋一下头发
and run my hand through my hair.

223
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,420
停下摩托车 摘掉头盔
Score a touchdown, whip the helmet off,

224
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:32,820
捋一下头发
run my hand through my hair.

225
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,240
有人说人靠衣装
People say clothes make the man,

226
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,200
其实根本不是这回事
but that makes no sense.

227
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:39,720
男人的精髓在于一头浓密的靓发
What makes the man is a nice head of hair.

228
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:41,700
该死 感觉好像我的头发还在一样
Damn it! It's like a phantom limb!

229
00:07:46,060 --> 00:07:47,000
不行 不行
No. No!

230
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,380
这一点都不像真的
This doesn't look real at all.

231
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:49,300
艾丽克斯 你早上
Alex, where's that blood

232
00:07:49,300 --> 00:07:50,800
涂在手指上的血是哪儿来的
you were using this morning on your finger?

233
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:53,080
在我血管里流着呢 好让我活着
Running through my veins, keeping me alive.

234
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,760
老爸回来了
Here comes dad.

235
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,100
他肯定会喊
He's gonna be all like,

236
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,360
不 你们干了什么
"No! What did you do?!

237
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,929
奇妙乐园哪去了
Where's AwesomeLand?!"

238
00:07:58,929 --> 00:08:02,320
不 你们干了什么 奇妙乐园哪去了
No! What did you do?! Where's AwesomeLand?!

239
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,520
你是来自未来的人吗
Are you from the future?

240
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:05,020
菲尔 亲爱的 亲爱的
Phil, honey, honey,

241
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:06,180
计划有一点小小的改变
w-we've had a little change of plans.

242
00:08:06,180 --> 00:08:06,700
为什么
Why?

243
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:07,780
你怎么在这
What are you even doing here?

244
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:08,560
不是要上班吗
Shouldn't you be at work?

245
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:11,240
那个超讨人厌的罗尼
That obnoxious Ronnie was worried

246
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,160
觉得我的装饰比不过他
that I wouldn't be able to handle his decorations,

247
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,140
因为他想赢
'cause he's trying to win

248
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:15,980
"这条街最可怕的房子"比赛
this "Scariest house on the street" contest,

249
00:08:15,980 --> 00:08:18,840
我就说 老娘不仅要装饰得比你好
and I was like, "Not only can I handle your decorations.

250
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:20,400
还要赢得比赛
I'm gonna win that contest."

251
00:08:20,420 --> 00:08:24,180
所以 欢迎来到地狱疯人院
So welcome to the insane asylum from hell.

252
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,620
我现在的感觉就像在地狱
That's what it feels like.

253
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,820
来嘛 很好玩的
Come on. It's gonna be fun.

254
00:08:26,820 --> 00:08:29,360
孩子们扮精神错乱的病人
The kids are gonna be deranged mental patients,

255
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:31,820
我来当虐待狂护士
and -- and I am going to be a sadistic nurse,

256
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:33,260
你就是神经病医生
and you are a demented doctor.

257
00:08:33,260 --> 00:08:34,460
20年来你都不同意
20 years of "No,"

258
00:08:34,460 --> 00:08:36,095
为了这破比赛 你就愿意穿护士装了吗
but for this, you'll dress like a nurse?!

259
00:08:36,095 --> 00:08:37,040
恶心
Um, no.

260
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:39,640
女的就该当护士 男的就该当医生
Of course the woman is the nurse and the man is the doctor.

261
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:42,320
这种重男轻女的思想 才可怕
That kind of thinking -- that's what's scary.

262
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,740
别说了 节日都被糟蹋了
Tap out. It's a holiday.

263
00:08:43,980 --> 00:08:46,140
我花了那么多时间和精力来装饰
You know, I put a lot of time and energy into my thing,

264
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:48,200
你就这样全给毁了 就为向我们不熟
but you just shut it all down to prove something

265
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:50,340
甚至根本不喜欢的人证明自己
to people that we barely know and don't even like!

266
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:52,760
菲尔 罗尼取笑了你的奇妙乐园
Phil, Ronnie made fun of Awesomeland.

267
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:54,440
他叫它"糖果乐园"
He called it "Candy Land".

268
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:54,800
那又怎样
So?

269
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:57,360
傻瓜镇 蠢蛋村
Stupidville? Dumbburgh?

270
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,620
谁管他怎么想
Who cares what he thinks?!

271
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:00,720
你什么时候在乎一下我的想法
Maybe someday you'll care what I think.

272
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:01,880
菲尔
Phil...

273
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,560
宝贝 看
Well -- honey, look!

274
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:04,940
你的兔子我还留着
I kept your bunny!

275
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,400
小啃啃你怎么了
Nibbles!

276
00:09:10,100 --> 00:09:11,000
终于赶上了
Made it in the nick of time.

277
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,480
趁我还是四千岁
All right, let's get this parade started

278
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,100
让游行开始吧
while I'm still just 4,000 years old.

279
00:09:14,396 --> 00:09:16,640
你知道游行要放学后才开始吧
You do know the parade's not till after school, right?

280
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:18,000
什么 我不知道
What? No!

281
00:09:18,060 --> 00:09:20,120
我待不了那么久 我有球队训练
I can't stay that long. I have football practice.

282
00:09:20,580 --> 00:09:21,900
我的天 我得去告诉莉莉
Oh, my god. I have to tell Lily.

283
00:09:21,900 --> 00:09:23,140
她肯定会很伤心
She's gonna be devastated.

284
00:09:25,820 --> 00:09:26,540
哦不
Oh, no.

285
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:28,040
沃尔多在哪里
Where's Waldo?

286
00:09:30,740 --> 00:09:33,120
游行什么时候变成放学后才开始了
Since when has the parade been after school?

287
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:35,413
一直都是 传单上写了
Since always. It was on the flier.

288
00:09:35,757 --> 00:09:37,912
单子有多大
How big was this flier?

289
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:40,420
现在我们改用视频聊天了吗
Oh, so this is how we call each other now?

290
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,200
米奇尔 我出了个装扮服状况
Mitchell, I have a costume emergency.

291
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:43,580
自信地穿上吧
Just wear it with confidence,

292
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:44,780
小卡 你穿着会很帅的
Cam. I'm sure you look great.

293
00:09:44,780 --> 00:09:46,140
不是 我找不到莉莉了
No, I can't find Lily!

294
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,100
找到了 在垃圾桶边
Oh, okay, found her -- by the trash can,

295
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:50,480
旁边有个穿得像流浪汉的大个子小朋友
next to the big kid dressed like a hobo.

296
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,795
还好你找到了
Oh, you did it.

297
00:09:52,474 --> 00:09:53,810
那个好像不是小朋友
I don't -- I don't think that's a kid.

298
00:09:53,940 --> 00:09:55,040
我得找个大人说一下
I should probably tell a grown-up.

299
00:09:55,460 --> 00:09:57,400
你真无法想像这里的状况
Well, you have no idea what's happening here.

300
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,240
速记员穿得像蜘蛛
The stenographer is dressed like a spider.

301
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:01,380
所有人都没在听我陈述
I cannot get anyone to listen to anything I'm --

302
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,620
米奇尔 回头说
Mitchell, I can't.

303
00:10:05,020 --> 00:10:05,500
莉莉
Lily?

304
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:06,940
宝贝 听我说
Honey, listen.

305
00:10:07,460 --> 00:10:08,800
大爸参加不了游行了
Daddy can't stay for the parade.

306
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:09,720
你答应过我的
But you promised!

307
00:10:09,780 --> 00:10:11,980
我知道 可是游行开始得太晚
No, I know I did, but it starts later than I thought,

308
00:10:11,980 --> 00:10:12,860
我必须去
and I have to get to...

309
00:10:12,860 --> 00:10:15,160
橄榄球训练 行 你走吧
Football practice! It's fine! Just go!

310
00:10:15,260 --> 00:10:16,420
别走 莉莉 等等我
No, Lily! Wait!

311
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,940
这下我又找不到她了
Well, she's gone forever.

312
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,680
歌洛莉亚 我头发去哪了
Gloria, what happened to my hair?

313
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:26,980
拜托 咱们不说这行不
Ay, no. Please. I cannot have this conversation again.

314
00:10:26,980 --> 00:10:29,060
是的 杰 时间就是杀猪刀
Yes, Jay, time is cruel.

315
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:31,460
我扮白马王子的假发 不见了
My Prince Charming wig -- it's gone.

316
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,660
你们觉得哪个好
Okay, what do you think --

317
00:10:33,020 --> 00:10:35,080
帅气夏威夷人还是性感苏格兰人
Handsome Hawaiian or sexy Scotsman?

318
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:36,240
现在没时间跟你说
I can't do this right now.

319
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,140
拜托 杰
Come on, Jay --

320
00:10:37,180 --> 00:10:38,360
这可是我最后一次
this is my farewell tour

321
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,611
在邻里间玩"不给糖就捣乱"
of trick-or-treating in the neighborhood.

322
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:40,960
我的造型必须要很抢眼
I have to go out strong.

323
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:42,980
还是我应该扮成别人所期待的那样呢
Or should I just do what people are expecting?

324
00:10:42,980 --> 00:10:44,120
别去要糖吃 因为你已经二十岁了
Stay home 'cause you're 20?

325
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,720
杰 不要对曼尼这么刻薄
Jay, please don't be mean to Manny.

326
00:10:45,800 --> 00:10:47,160
可能是斯黛拉把你的假发
Maybe Stella took your wig

327
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,360
叼到后院埋起来了
and buried it in the yard.

328
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,020
之前我看到她在玩那个
I saw her playing with it earlier.

329
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,420
什么 你为什么不把它抢过来
What? Why didn't you take it from her?

330
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:53,420
我不了解你们之间的关系
I don't understand your relationship with her.

331
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,200
你还让她舔你的脚
You let her lick your feet.

332
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,260
那有什么关系
Who is that possibly hurting?

333
00:10:57,260 --> 00:10:58,000
我现在该怎么办
What am I gonna do now?

334
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,120
白马王子是有头发的
Prince Charming had hair!

335
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,280
得了吧 这事我们又不能确定
Please. We don't really know that for sure.

336
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:03,180
那个时候又没有照相机
There weren't cameras back then.

337
00:11:03,180 --> 00:11:05,600
也许就是因为他光头才必须要更迷人呢
Maybe he had to be charming because he was bald.

338
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,060
你觉得把你未成年女儿
You really think it's appropriate

339
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:12,300
绑在医用轮床上合适吗
to be strapping your teenage daughter to a gurney?

340
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:13,620
只要能赢就行
If we win, it is.

341
00:11:13,854 --> 00:11:15,502
待会我要去厕所
I may have to take a pee break soon.

342
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,520
在这 用这个便盆
Ooh. Here. Use this bedpan.

343
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:18,920
我开玩笑的 那多恶心
I'm kidding. That's gross.

344
00:11:19,020 --> 00:11:20,540
我把糖放在里面 拿着
I put candy in it. Here.

345
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:22,660
卢克
Luke.

346
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:25,020
卢克
Luke!

347
00:11:26,140 --> 00:11:27,140
我刚才好像睡着了
I think I fell asleep.

348
00:11:27,620 --> 00:11:29,280
这玩意就像自闭症专家发明的拥抱机器
This thing is like a Temple Grandin hug.

349
00:11:29,907 --> 00:11:32,560
海莉宝贝 衣服穿反了
Haley, sweetie, uh, gown's on backwards.

350
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,820
没有 这样更可爱
Oh, no. It's cuter this way.

351
00:11:34,220 --> 00:11:35,680
性感的人也会发疯 知道吗
Sexy people go crazy, too, you know.

352
00:11:35,780 --> 00:11:36,680
去看看《人物》杂质上的报道
Read a People magazine.

353
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:38,800
菲尔
Phil.

354
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:41,860
你连试都不试一下你的医生服装吗
You're not even gonna try on your doctor costume?

355
00:11:42,100 --> 00:11:42,340
是的
Nope.

356
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:44,040
但我们要赢了
But we're gonna win.

357
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,160
这难道不会让你感到高兴吗
Doesn't that make you happy?

358
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,000
我看起来像高兴吗
Do I look happy?

359
00:11:46,820 --> 00:11:47,940
你有麻烦了 女士
You got a problem, lady.

360
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,760
这种暗黑恐怖的偏执感
This obsessive need to be dark and scary --

361
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:51,060
你自己根本都停不下来了
you can't even stop yourself.

362
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,740
我什么时候想停 就会停
I can stop whenever I want.

363
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,800
我无法融入这种气氛
Well, I'm not getting sucked in.

364
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:56,880
我要过自己想过的万圣节
I'm having the Halloween that I wanted.

365
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,940
这些都是什么
What is all this?

366
00:11:59,980 --> 00:12:01,260
这是要表现得很滑稽吗
Is this supposed to be funny?

367
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:02,760
不 应该是很可怕
No, it's supposed to be scary.

368
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,180
不 应该是很奇妙
No, it's supposed to be awesome.

369
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,720
知道吗 其实我看得出来
You know, I could tell that you guys

370
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:07,400
你们并不喜欢我们搬过来
didn't love us moving in next door.

371
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,353
可能因为罗尼是卖大麻的
Maybe 'cause Ronnie deals pot

372
00:12:09,353 --> 00:12:11,590
也可能因为我的星条旗比基尼
or maybe 'cause of my confederate-flag bikini.

373
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:13,440
我不知道 但是
I don't know, but --

374
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:15,471
但是我以为我们在慢慢成为朋友
But I thought we were becomin' friends.

375
00:12:15,820 --> 00:12:18,640
我还准备邀请你们一起过感恩节 可是
I was gonna propose a joint Thanksgiving, but...

376
00:12:18,640 --> 00:12:20,540
这招简直太低级了
This is really low.

377
00:12:20,540 --> 00:12:21,840
不 亲爱的 没事的
No, honey, it's okay.

378
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,360
不 怎么会没事 罗尼
No, it's not okay, Ronnie!

379
00:12:23,540 --> 00:12:24,980
这太无礼 也太残忍了
It's rude and it's cruel!

380
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,420
真希望我们的老房子还在
I wish we had our old house

381
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:27,300
这样就能马上把家开走
so we could drive it away

382
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:28,320
开得越远越好[房车]
as far as possible!

383
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:31,578
天哪 这是演的哪一出
Oh, my goodness. What was that?

384
00:12:33,920 --> 00:12:35,660
安布尔对这事很敏感
Amber gets touchy about this stuff.

385
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,080
她...
Uh, she --

386
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:42,600
她在内华达州的一间疯人院待过半年
she spent six months in a cuckoo farm in Nevada.

387
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,960
对不起 我这样说她会生气的
I'm sorry. She gets mad when I say that.

388
00:12:45,060 --> 00:12:46,200
是在犹他州
It was in Utah.

389
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,360
天哪
Oh, my god.

390
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,186
我们真的不知道 我发誓
We -- we had no idea. I swear.

391
00:12:49,186 --> 00:12:50,699
没关系
I-it's cool.

392
00:12:50,699 --> 00:12:53,140
我会给她一盒嘎吱船长麦片
I'll just...give her a box of Cap'n Crunch

393
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:54,760
再把她放到鱼缸前面
and set her in front of the fish tank.

394
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:55,800
那会让她平静下来
That seems to calm her down.

395
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:57,025
-好吧 -好吧
- Okay. - Okay.

396
00:12:59,632 --> 00:13:02,013
我们得清理掉这些 我们得清理掉这些
We have to shut it down. We got to shut it down.

397
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:05,300
她说"感恩节一起过"[大麻烟卷感恩节]
Now, when she said "Joint thanksgiving,"

398
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:06,960
你觉得她是不是指...
do you think that she meant --

399
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,160
-不是 -好吧
- No. - Okay.

400
00:13:09,860 --> 00:13:11,060
每一间公司
Each of these companies

401
00:13:11,071 --> 00:13:13,509
都把未上报的资金存入同一个账户
funneled unreported funds into the same account.

402
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:15,100
我相信这张图表可以使这个
Now, I believe this chart makes clear

403
00:13:15,100 --> 00:13:16,380
复杂骗局的网络清晰化
the intricate web of deceit.

404
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,700
好的 我听到了
Okay, I heard it.

405
00:13:17,700 --> 00:13:19,565
我 我重新叙述一遍
I'm -- I'm gonna rephrase that.

406
00:13:20,385 --> 00:13:21,440
这些公司密谋
These companies conspired

407
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,940
欺骗众多的无辜民众
to defraud numerous innocent people,

408
00:13:23,940 --> 00:13:26,400
还有国内收入署
not to mention the Internal Revenue Service.

409
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,740
对不起 对不起
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

410
00:13:27,884 --> 00:13:29,380
法官阁下 可以上前吗
Your honor, may we approach?

411
00:13:29,380 --> 00:13:30,460
如果你一定需要的话
If you must.

412
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:33,980
你看到这里发生了什么 对吧
You see what's happening here, right?

413
00:13:34,080 --> 00:13:35,280
你连续输五场官司了
You're losing your fifth case in a row?

414
00:13:35,280 --> 00:13:36,579
四场
Fourth. And --

415
00:13:36,782 --> 00:13:37,907
谁说的 我要输了吗
Who said -- am I losing?

416
00:13:37,907 --> 00:13:40,340
我认为 陪审团
Um, I just feel that the -- the jury

417
00:13:40,340 --> 00:13:43,340
会被那个分散注意力 你知道的
might be a little bit distracted by, um...you know.

418
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:46,960
记录员请记录下来 辩方律师
Please let the record show that counsel is nodding his head

419
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,540
朝法庭速记员奥利点头
towards the court stenographer, Holly.

420
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,500
法官阁下 辩方律师是想抓住
Your honor, opposing counsel's

421
00:13:50,500 --> 00:13:51,300
最后一棵救命稻草
grasping at straws

422
00:13:51,300 --> 00:13:52,280
因为他又要输了
because he's losing again.

423
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:53,540
拜托 拜托
Oh, come on! Come on!

424
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:54,720
她穿得像个大蜘蛛
She's dressed like a giant spider!

425
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:57,160
我需要陪审团集中注意力到案情上
I need the jury to focus on the details of this case,

426
00:13:57,160 --> 00:13:58,840
而不是这身奇装异服
not some ridiculous costume.

427
00:13:58,940 --> 00:14:00,800
抱歉 你可能是个很好的人
I'm sorry. You're probably a very nice person.

428
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:01,700
好吧
Very well.

429
00:14:01,940 --> 00:14:04,720
奥利 你能把装扮去掉吗
Holly, would you please remove the costume?

430
00:14:04,940 --> 00:14:05,600
谢谢
Thank you.

431
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:08,660
女士们先生们 很抱歉要延时了
Ladies and gentlemen, I apologize for the delay.

432
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,100
根据律师要求
At the request of counsel,

433
00:14:10,260 --> 00:14:12,860
法庭速记员将脱去装扮
the court stenographer will now remove the costume.

434
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:15,820
这个红头发真扫兴
That redhead's no fun.

435
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:19,120
他们讨厌你
They hate you.

436
00:14:20,492 --> 00:14:22,460
根据我之前所说
A-as I was saying, um,

437
00:14:22,460 --> 00:14:25,820
这些公司窃取了无数无辜民众的钱
these companies stole from countless innocent people,

438
00:14:25,820 --> 00:14:27,280
各位知道
and, you know,

439
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:29,580
如果有人像那样伸手掏我的蛋
if someone had dipped into my nest egg like that, uh...

440
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,860
我肯定会怒不可遏
I'd be awful grouchy.

441
00:14:36,580 --> 00:14:37,540
连输第四场
Number four.

442
00:14:38,940 --> 00:14:39,560
给你
Here you go.

443
00:14:40,180 --> 00:14:41,200
你扮的是什么[你本来应该怎样]
What are you supposed to be?

444
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:42,220
生在别人家里
Born into another family.

445
00:14:42,460 --> 00:14:43,960
她扮的是苔丝·麦克吉尔
She is Tess McGill,

446
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:46,160
八十年代经典《打工女郎》里的
feminist heroine from te 1980s classic

447
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:46,680
女权主义者
"Working Girl".

448
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:47,880
有机会要去看看哦
You should check it out sometime.

449
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:48,900
过几年吧
In a few years.

450
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:50,480
有用吸尘器吸小鸡鸡的镜头
There is some light vacuuming in underpants.

451
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:51,800
继续努力
Keep up the good work!

452
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,100
这边情况如何
How's it going here?

453
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:54,100
我看起来很蠢
I look stupid!

454
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:56,000
这些小狗狗让我没法
These puppies are making it impossible

455
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,440
再生你的气
for me to stay mad at you.

456
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:58,880
愚蠢又可爱的狗狗们
Stupid, adorable puppies.

457
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,720
欢迎来到奇妙乐园
Welcome to AwesomeLand,

458
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:03,540
这里你唯一需要害怕的是乐趣本身
where the only thing to fear is fun itself.

459
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,200
克莱尔 我知道这不是你想要的万圣节
Claire, I know this isn't the Halloween you wanted,

460
00:15:06,220 --> 00:15:07,340
可你能至少做个样子吗
but can you try to sell it?

461
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,320
对不起 亲爱的
I'm sorry, honey.

462
00:15:08,340 --> 00:15:10,600
我冲你发火 还伤害了安布尔
I got mad at you and I upset Amber,

463
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,360
就因为罗尼叫我"孩奴"
and all because Ronnie called me a soccer mom.

464
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,540
我是什么毛病
What is wrong with me?

465
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:15,200
你没病
Nothing.

466
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:17,500
我也很讨厌别人胡乱下一些
I hate it when people assume things about me

467
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:18,120
错误的结论
that aren't true --

468
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:20,400
比如因为我漂亮 我就一定很傲慢
Like because I'm pretty, I'm stuck-up.

469
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:22,260
要是有人那么对我 我就会说
When people do that to me, I'm just like,

470
00:15:22,380 --> 00:15:24,320
闭嘴 混蛋 我为什么要跟你说话
"Shut up, troll. Why am I even talking to you?"

471
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:27,820
我不喜欢被人分类
I do not like being pigeonholed.

472
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:29,380
很明显 妈妈
It's obvious, mom --

473
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:31,740
你通过万圣节来告诉大家你也是很犀利的
You use Halloween as a way to show people you have edge.

474
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,940
就像会计师买了台哈雷机车
It's like accountants who buy a harley.

475
00:15:35,520 --> 00:15:36,320
她说得对
She's right.

476
00:15:36,920 --> 00:15:38,940
扮恐怖就是我那部机车
Being scary is my motorcycle.

477
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:40,364
这才是我的苔丝
That's my Tess.

478
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:43,720
我的告别之旅可能带了太多情绪
I knew my farewell tour would be emotional,

479
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:46,060
但至少我做能说自己做到了我想做的
but at least I can say I did it my way.

480
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,120
你已经说了四遍了
You've said that four times.

481
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,664
你知道他别的歌吗
You know he had other songs?

482
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:51,720
妆化得不错 是富兰克林吧
Nice costume. Ben Franklin, right?

483
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:54,400
你开什么玩笑 这是白马王子
What? No! Prince Charming.

484
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:55,100
好吧
Oh. Sorry.

485
00:15:55,112 --> 00:15:57,380
我以为白马王子是有头发的
I guess I just picture Prince Charming with hair.

486
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:59,320
我也这么认为 但是我的假发丢了
We all do, but I lost my wig,

487
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:01,280
我头发也掉光了
And I don't have any, so...

488
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:02,160
好吧 其实有些
Well, you know, there are

489
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,640
好方法是可以治谢顶的
some pretty effective solutions for that.

490
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:04,920
-你在说植发 -对啊
- Talking about hair plugs? - Yeah.

491
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,780
从两边和脑勺取一点移到头顶
Take some from the side and the back, right?

492
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:07,960
你觉得那对我有用吗
You think that would work for me?

493
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:09,560
应该会
It could.

494
00:16:09,980 --> 00:16:12,460
但是你最好咨询一下真正的医生
But you might want a second opinion from an actual doctor.

495
00:16:13,020 --> 00:16:13,700
打扰一下
Excuse me.

496
00:16:15,580 --> 00:16:18,660
你刚才和这个装医生的讨论植发吗
Did you just ask that fake doctor about hair plugs?

497
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,580
没有 你知道你的英文不太好
No! You know how you struggle with the language.

498
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:22,020
-杰 -该死 歌洛莉亚
- Jay. - Damn it, Gloria.

499
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,500
我很怀念有头发的日子
I miss having a head full of hair.

500
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:25,160
还有不要表现得好像你不希望我有头发
And don't act like you don't miss it, too.

501
00:16:25,160 --> 00:16:25,920
我们结婚的时候
When we got married,

502
00:16:25,980 --> 00:16:28,080
你就比现在多了四根头发
you had four more hairs than you do now.

503
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:29,640
你这个样子我一点都不吃惊
This is not a surprise to me.

504
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,460
那今天早些时候呢
What about today? Hmm? Earlier?

505
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:32,840
我们没在打盹的时候
When we were not napping?

506
00:16:33,460 --> 00:16:35,680
当你性致高昂的时候
When you were a little extra-enthusiastic?

507
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:38,320
那是因为你兴致高
Because you were enthusiastic.

508
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:41,160
你给我们所有人买了万圣节装扮
You went out and bought costumes for all of us,

509
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:42,080
你还在唱歌
you were singing.

510
00:16:42,260 --> 00:16:44,960
至少这次你没有说"我才没兴趣呢"
For once, you were not like, "I don't want to do this.

511
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,780
我只想在家里边看高尔夫球
"I just want to sit at home, watch golf,

512
00:16:46,780 --> 00:16:48,460
边吃我的墨西哥式十层开胃菜
And eat my 10-layer dip."

513
00:16:48,460 --> 00:16:49,720
五层 只有五层
Just five. Five layers.

514
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:51,720
一层就足够了 杰
One layer is enough, Jay.

515
00:16:51,956 --> 00:16:55,230
我超爱你和我们一起玩
I loved that you were having fun with us.

516
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,500
一个快乐的老公
A happy husband --

517
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,160
对我来说才是最性感的
that's what is sexy to me.

518
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,740
所以你不觉得我像富兰克林吗
So you don't think I look like Ben Franklin?

519
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,980
对了 原来是他
Oh, yes! That's who it is!

520
00:17:02,980 --> 00:17:06,537
一百美金钞票上那个男人 我的最爱
The man from the $100 bill -- my favorite!

521
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,140
好吧 万圣节快乐
All right, Happy Halloween.

522
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:12,120
那就是你的万圣节装扮吗 一个大鼻子
That's your costume? A big nose?

523
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,120
听着 别说那么多废话
All right, you know, cool it.

524
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,140
我今天过得很惨
I've had a rough day.

525
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:15,940
你以为你是我今天见的第一个海绵宝宝吗
You think you're the first SpongeBob I've seen?

526
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:18,800
要错过万圣节的欢乐了
I'm missing Halloween.

527
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:20,820
亲 如果大爸五分钟之内不回来的话
All right, honey, if daddy's not home in five minutes,

528
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:22,400
我就带你去要糖好不
I will take you trick-or-treating, okay?

529
00:17:22,505 --> 00:17:24,160
我回来了
Okay! I made it!

530
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,520
橄榄球训练延时了 亲爱的
Football practice ran late, sweetie.

531
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:27,540
再给我两分钟 我很抱歉
Just give me two minutes. I'm so sorry.

532
00:17:28,320 --> 00:17:28,660
随便
Whatever.

533
00:17:28,660 --> 00:17:31,441
我敢说套装糖果肯定都发光了
I bet all the full-size candy bars are gone.

534
00:17:31,452 --> 00:17:32,749
-莉莉 -不 不
- Lily. - Nope, nope.

535
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:33,860
她有权生气 米奇尔
She has every right, Mitchell.

536
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,600
我让橄榄球吞噬了我的生活
You know, I've let football consume my life,

537
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:39,220
我疏漏了对我而言最宝贵的东西
And I fumbled what's most valuable to me,

538
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,360
现在 我卡住了
And now I'm stuck!

539
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:41,540
能不能来个人帮帮我啊
Can somebody please help me?

540
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:43,380
-别去帮他 -够了 你们两个
- Don't help him! - Oh, enough, you two!

541
00:17:43,380 --> 00:17:45,400
简直跟《八月: 奥色治郡》电影里一样混乱
It's like "August: osage county" Up in here.

542
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,704
-好了 你得... -我的头呢
- All right, you -- - Where's my head?

543
00:17:46,704 --> 00:17:49,120
就在这儿 等一下 冷静 好吗
It's right here. Stop. Just calm down. Okay.

544
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:50,800
你别再自责不已了 好吗
You need to let yourself off the hook, all right?

545
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:52,420
你又不是抛弃她 自己去玩了
You didn't abandon her playing craps.

546
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:53,480
你是要去工作
You had to go to work.

547
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,120
他只顾着工作
He's always working.

548
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:57,140
不 他...
No, he's --

549
00:17:57,140 --> 00:17:59,280
他并没有只顾着工作啊 莉莉
He is not always working, Lily.

550
00:17:59,920 --> 00:18:01,300
证物A 你的上衣
Exhibit "A" -- your shirt,

551
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:02,580
他可是熬夜缝了一晚上
which he stayed up all night sewing

552
00:18:02,580 --> 00:18:04,260
才让你穿上这完美的装扮服
so that you would have the perfect costume.

553
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,280
证物B
Exhibit "B" --

554
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:07,600
你的眼镜 他在易趣网上淘了两小时
Those glasses--two hours on eBay.

555
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,780
证物C 你的小背包
Exhibit "C" -- your satchel.

556
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:11,260
那是二爸读大学时用的挎包
Daddy's man purse from college

557
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:12,960
他翻了10个杂物箱才找到的
that he had to dig through 10 boxes to find,

558
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,100
因为二爸藏着不想让他找到
because daddy hid it from him.

559
00:18:14,100 --> 00:18:16,015
但他没看那个传单啊
But he didn't read the flier!

560
00:18:16,460 --> 00:18:17,840
我没有看
I never read it

561
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:19,340
是因为我根本没见到
Because I never saw it!

562
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:21,280
-你没见到那张传单吗 -没有
- You didn't see the flier? - No!

563
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:23,140
或许是因为你根本没收到
Maybe that's because you never got it.

564
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:26,522
我来向你呈上 那张传单
I submit to you...the flier...

565
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:28,940
根本没被贴到冰箱上
which never made it onto the refrigerator,

566
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:30,448
你本该把重要文件都贴在那里的
where you are supposed to put things,

567
00:18:30,448 --> 00:18:33,474
因为它...
because it wa-a-a-s....

568
00:18:33,860 --> 00:18:36,620
它...在...
It...was...

569
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:37,500
找到
Yes.

570
00:18:39,020 --> 00:18:41,360
莉莉 你大爸或许错过了游行
Lily, your daddy may have missed the parade,

571
00:18:41,360 --> 00:18:43,080
但他真是为万圣节用尽了心思
but he was all over Halloween.

572
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:46,140
我的陈述终止
I rest my case.

573
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:47,680
对不起 大爸
I'm sorry, daddy.

574
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:49,000
我也该说对不起
I'm sorry, too.

575
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:53,080
我成功胜诉
I got my win.

576
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,200
如果陪审团里都是
Trials would be a whole lot easier

577
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,200
像莉莉这样的7岁小女孩
if juries were made up of

578
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,400
那庭审就简单多了
7-year-old girls, like Lily.

579
00:18:57,400 --> 00:18:58,220
或者像小卡那样的
And Cam.

580
00:18:59,320 --> 00:19:00,560
我知道那不是重点
I know it's not the point,

581
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:01,929
但我们原本肯定会赢的
but we totally would've won.

582
00:19:01,929 --> 00:19:03,762
你在道歉时最好别提这句
Might want to leave that out of your apology.

583
00:19:04,064 --> 00:19:04,504
你们好啊
Howdy!

584
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:07,100
嘿 罗尼 你还好吗
Hey, Ronnie. What's up?

585
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:10,380
罗尼 我在找安布尔呢
Ronnie, hi. Um, I was looking for Amber.

586
00:19:10,380 --> 00:19:11,280
她在里面呢
Oh, she's inside.

587
00:19:11,280 --> 00:19:11,841
不 我不在
No, I ain't!

588
00:19:11,841 --> 00:19:13,752
别闹了 安布尔
Knock it off, Amber!

589
00:19:14,400 --> 00:19:15,140
安布尔 你好
Amber, hi.

590
00:19:15,140 --> 00:19:17,120
听着 我想道个歉
Um, listen, I wanted to apologize.

591
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:19,200
我之前完全不知道你过去的经历
I had no idea about your history,

592
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,600
我太不懂得照顾你的情绪了
and I was being insensitive,

593
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:22,880
所以我希望我们能重新和睦相处
so I was hoping we could start over.

594
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:25,400
真的好温暖人心啊
That's really sweet.

595
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:28,660
都让我为编造那事感到愧疚了
Almost makes me feel bad for making the whole thing up.

596
00:19:29,140 --> 00:19:29,600
什么
What?!

597
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:30,640
骗到啦
Trick!

598
00:19:30,952 --> 00:19:33,200
她根本没被关进过疯人院
She never been to a nuthouse.

599
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:33,720
不是吧
No!

600
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:35,580
是啊 我才没疯呢
Yeah, I ain't crazy.

601
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:37,260
我倒是进过几次戒毒所
I mean, I've been to rehab a few times,

602
00:19:37,260 --> 00:19:38,720
但那最多算是薪资照拿的度假
but that was just for paid vacation.

603
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:41,360
你撒谎 就是为了让我感到愧疚吗
You lied just to make me feel bad?

604
00:19:41,660 --> 00:19:43,140
不不 我们撒谎
No, no -- we lied

605
00:19:43,140 --> 00:19:46,380
那样我们的"僵尸妓女屋"就能获胜了
so that we could win with our zombie house o' whores!

606
00:19:46,500 --> 00:19:47,920
真是太没有下限了
That is so messed up.

607
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,200
你刚刚说的是"妓女"还是...
Did you say "Whores," Or --

608
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:50,260
不不 那可不叫没下限
No, no. It ain't messed up.

609
00:19:50,280 --> 00:19:52,340
本来的说法就是"不给糖就捣蛋"
The saying is "Trick or treat."

610
00:19:52,340 --> 00:19:53,401
我们这玩的就是"捣蛋"
This is the trick part.

611
00:19:54,313 --> 00:19:56,500
我们的院子里都是死妓女
Our yard's full o' dead whores.

612
00:19:56,500 --> 00:19:58,000
你的院子里却是圣诞老人
You got a santa.

613
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:59,440
好吧 我听清了 是妓女
Yep -- "Whores." I heard it again.

614
00:19:59,460 --> 00:20:00,540
我们何不谈谈这个呢
Why are we not talking about this?

615
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:03,820
总有一天 你们会为此付出代价的
There will come a day when you will pay for this.

616
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:05,460
你们不知道是什么时候
You won't know when,

617
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:07,020
也不知道是什么方式
and you won't know how,

618
00:20:07,020 --> 00:20:09,020
但你们会亲身感受到的
but you will feel it.

619
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:16,440
那个小妞好吓人
That chick is scary.

620
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:17,800
谢谢
Thank you.

621
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:19,740
你完全无法想象
You have no idea.

622
00:20:22,740 --> 00:20:26,380
厂家故意画的让你找不到他
You know, they just make it impossible to find him.

623
00:20:26,620 --> 00:20:28,380
那很残忍 也很不合适
It's cruel and inappropriate.

624
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:30,060
那让孩子们注定只能失败
It just sets children up to fail,

625
00:20:30,060 --> 00:20:31,960
那会摧毁他们的自尊心
and it destroys their self-esteem.

626
00:20:33,100 --> 00:20:34,560
-就在那儿 -在吗
- Right there. - Is he there?

627
00:20:34,560 --> 00:20:35,743
在哪儿呢
Is -- where --

628
00:20:36,046 --> 00:20:38,281
她刚刚指的哪儿 指的哪儿啊
Where did she point? Where did she p--

629
00:20:41,140 --> 00:20:42,840
现在我看上去像歌手罗德·斯图尔特了
Now I look like Rod Stewart.

630
00:20:43,820 --> 00:20:44,660
谢你了啊
Thanks a lot.

631
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:50,160
我有着商业的头脑 诱人犯罪的身体
I have a head for business and a bod for sin.

632
00:20:50,560 --> 00:20:51,500
是啊 没错
Yes, you do.

633
00:20:51,970 --> 00:20:53,850
真恶心 这可是公共区域呢
Ew! This is a common area!
